# =============================================================================
# 0001-maestro-readiness-probe-context-gate.patch
# =============================================================================
# Subject: AISHA Maestro USP integrity gate — runtime CONTEXT_ENABLED check
#
# WHY:
#   Upstream Maestro `/health` endpoint kontroluje pouze CPU/disk/memory
#   (liveness). Pokud někdo manuálně přepne CONTEXT_ENABLED=false v Coolify
#   env UI (např. omylem při debugu), Maestro tiše degraduje na single-turn
#   responses — multi-turn coherence USP (Alexa Prize heritage) je ztracená,
#   ale healthcheck stále vrací 200. Tento patch přidá readiness probe
#   `/health/ready`, která vrátí 503 při CONTEXT_ENABLED=false (runtime
#   čteno přes pydantic settings, žádný hardcoded fallback).
#
# Target: aisha/insight@96ec8f25883d1ce5559add3f2ebd3c0b8d79f247
#
# Upgrade workflow:
#   1. Pull new upstream version: cd packages/insight && git pull origin main
#   2. Update parent submodule pointer: git add packages/insight && git commit
#   3. Verify patch still applies: scripts/insight-patches-apply.sh --check
#   4. Pokud konflikt: fix v submodule WD, regenerate patch:
#        cd packages/insight && git diff > ../../aisha/insight-patches/0001-...patch
#      Update Target: header above to new commit SHA.
# =============================================================================

